[BG4Def]

; MIGRATION: action blocks moved ABOVE the [BG4 n] elements. This engine
; resolves 'actionno' against actions already parsed, so actions defined later
; in the section (e.g. action 19 was at line ~1205, after the elements using it)
; were reported as "Missing action" and BG4 failed to load entirely.
; MIGRATION: these actionno values are referenced by BG4 elements but are
; defined nowhere in this file (they are absent from the stable build's copy
; too). The 2024 engine skipped such elements; this engine aborts the whole
; BG, which made Scene 4 render black. Empty stub actions let BG4 load with
; every real element intact -- replace them if the artwork should appear.
